  "body": "When mypy doesn't know what a type is it treats it as `Any`, this has lead to bugs that we thought mypy was catching. We should consider if we should flesh our more of our type hints from 3rd party modules instead of ignoring them.\r\n\r\nThere's also the https://github.com/python/typeshed/ project, but according to that README it is included in mypy. It doesn't seem like there's too many projects available in that TBH.",
